      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "A total YES. BUT only one or two objects at the same time (more in the inventory). \nThe total poly count of all spawned objects, including the avatar itself, may not exceed 20000 polygons and 5x5x5 units. Objects have to be loaded on the fly.\nMost important the spawned object has to disappear at a certain distance to it's creator (10-15 units). \n\nI have stuff like lamps and weapons in mind or something like a camera when I think about an inventory. Or simply the pictures of the camera. \nI hope the above takes some of the worms out of the can.\nOh and it would be cool if we could flag some stuff to be shareable and other things private.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
