      "spam": false,
      "value": "We're calling this \"Avatar Props\" and there's a design in the works considering many of the things discussed here in the post. There's lots to balance and work out but I would very much like to see props and inventory in VRChat. The other thing to consider with this and other aspects of VRChat is creators being able to earn from their work down the line.",
