      "value": "When I first heard about this game I was under the assumption that it had something like this. I could've sworn I saw an image of someone with an inventory system with umbrellas and guns and stuff that they were ready to grab and spawn in game for a time until they let go of it. Would be mega useful to have something like that instead of an animation override where it would only happen for a short amount of time.",
