      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: In the menu you can keep as many props as you like since the actual object is only loaded when you spawn it. I mean there should be a limit of objects a player can spawn and they should disapear/respawn when they are droped and the distance to the owner exceeds lets say 15 units or a given amount of time has passed. That way trolls have limited options from the beginning.",
