      "postID": "58dd8580eb1593550fc2cad3",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding my 2 cents to an old thread...\n\n= Natural Object Spawning from Avatars\nA new special Component that can be attached to avatar, which spawns an item on collision (configurable), would be very nice (imagine drawing some magic items / swords out from clothes) and easier to use than menu UI based spawning.\n\n= Multiple Item Developer Tiers\nAlmost anyone should be able to upload items with very restricted component whitelist (similar or more restricted than avatar). We can also imagine each user's items instance containing server-generated digital watermark (in textures & 3D meshes) to prevent illegal copying. (this is particularly important for monetizing)\n\nOpening up C# scripting to engaged 3rd party (corporate) developers can open up lots of opportunities, similar to how mobile apps platform works. This probably requires manual inspection of submitted source code for a while & special contracts.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
