      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A really good idea for this would be similar to avatars. I don't see a problem with allowing hundreds of these as some people (like me) have hundreds of avatars which have these objects as built in props. If we can have some trigger options for them like click to do an animation it would be great so we could make guns, swords, camera objects, stereos, etc. Make it so only one is equippable at a time but you can upload as many of these as you like and they can be selected from a list. Optionally have it so you can hand it to someone else and you can pull out a new object. The other person cannot until they drop the item you gave them resulting in it returning to your inventory. They can continue holding it after you leave but if they drop it, it is gone. Just my personal idea of how this should work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
